    {"entry_index":7,"uid":"zhcn:2793f004eb19f1d96d214133","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"因为有你，离梦想更近一步了哦。","source_fingerprint":"01f59c1ff5924276efa89ca7542492ea98bce965e312d58bd86dca0397a9a5f2","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","20049"],"target_text":"Nhờ có anh, em lại tiến gần giấc mơ thêm một bước rồi.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":8,"uid":"zhcn:9a07beaf2ab5c078c21d57dc","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我们有所成长了呢。","source_fingerprint":"a7c469e57a4496f9528e401a9a50135361a7c3e3149a049387d67534f77ebd8d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","20050"],"target_text":"Chúng ta đã trưởng thành hơn rồi nhỉ.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":9,"uid":"zhcn:e21d7cf14bf689fa8f035808","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"一起加油吧……！","source_fingerprint":"3ad1c0e0857bce4cf553024380b2a49755752106372acf829b6da8220679ace0","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","20051"],"target_text":"Cùng cố gắng nhé…!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":10,"uid":"zhcn:46ef37f5c9225a019adf441c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"一起加油吧！","source_fingerprint":"27034d160af1c1f09dc5bc82dd514313c27a89258641f741350dfcc49d329de0","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","2030"],"target_text":"Cùng cố gắng nhé!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":11,"uid":"zhcn:5ed6a0e987db442f9cd8b294","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我们的话没问题！","source_fingerprint":"34d1070fcfb23394b80811f0eaf5380e29c64925365f0298bc7abd87631c2e79","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","2031"],"target_text":"Nếu là chúng ta thì không sao đâu!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":12,"uid":"zhcn:88e5691521ca5549ff41fbc9","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我们有所成长了呢。","source_fingerprint":"a7c469e57a4496f9528e401a9a50135361a7c3e3149a049387d67534f77ebd8d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","2032"],"target_text":"Chúng ta đã trưởng thành hơn rồi nhỉ.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":13,"uid":"zhcn:a405861c17d7e00524ad65f4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"紧张？……不，完全没有！\n今天会遇见怎样的光辉呢……\n我满脑子都在想这个。","source_fingerprint":"5cdc4e01fab59ea3fa11852270fb11cadede9ff3ca428142174789034bf34029","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","2033"],"target_text":"Căng thẳng á? …Không, hoàn toàn không!\nHôm nay mình sẽ gặp được ánh sáng rực rỡ thế nào nhỉ…\nTrong đầu em chỉ toàn nghĩ đến chuyện đó thôi.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":14,"uid":"zhcn:1d064f2bfd1f5b89e3a38b9e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"只要有大家的支持和你的心意——\n无论到哪里我都能奔跑下去哦！","source_fingerprint":"cbaecb33b130a9de572403a5640db5c3f9d6b77e945f2cb71bb9c3af8116c439","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","2034"],"target_text":"Chỉ cần có sự cổ vũ của mọi người và tấm lòng của anh—\ndù đến đâu em cũng có thể tiếp tục chạy!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":15,"uid":"zhcn:1eb813923dd8ec5a92e63182","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我们有所成长了呢。","source_fingerprint":"a7c469e57a4496f9528e401a9a50135361a7c3e3149a049387d67534f77ebd8d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","2035"],"target_text":"Chúng ta đã trưởng thành hơn rồi nhỉ.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":16,"uid":"zhcn:d521626bd5d0997fc55ce8bb","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好！","source_fingerprint":"49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","23015"],"target_text":"Được!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":17,"uid":"zhcn:df613d0957416307249b32a6","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"达成那片景色，还差一步……！","source_fingerprint":"9e10348cb238ff9e804bde636d364b79933891d52c3443197cd459594d7f0a80","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","30000"],"target_text":"Chỉ còn một bước nữa là chạm tới khung cảnh ấy…!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":18,"uid":"zhcn:8e4a06f75e4a29c6a3ae5454","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"看着吧，下次会更加闪耀！","source_fingerprint":"fba5fed582f192c22c2cb23bfaf86a890fc54d51d93a705291039ab253ac87a6","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1114","30001"],"target_text":"Cứ xem nhé, lần sau em sẽ còn tỏa sáng hơn nữa!","reviewed":true},
